---
source: bin/tests/shell_idiom.rs
---
stdenv.mkDerivation { installPhase = ''
  cat $files | sort > all
  n=$(grep pat lib/*.php | wc -l)
  sort -k2 x | uniq
  mkdir -p $out/a
  mkdir -p $out/b
  v=$(cat "$f")
  sed -i 's,#!/usr/bin/env bash,#!${stdenv.shell},' x
''; }
---
[shellcheck] Advice: ShellCheck found issues in an inline shell script
   ╭─[ <temp_file_path>:2:7 ]
   │
 2 │   cat $files | sort > all
   │       ───┬──  
   │          ╰──── SC2086: Double quote to prevent globbing and word splitting.
 3 │   n=$(grep pat lib/*.php | wc -l)
   │       ─────────┬────────  
   │                ╰────────── SC2126: Consider using 'grep -c' instead of 'grep|wc -l'.
   │ 
 5 │   mkdir -p $out/a
   │            ──┬─  
   │              ╰─── SC2086: Double quote to prevent globbing and word splitting.
 6 │   mkdir -p $out/b
   │            ──┬─  
   │              ╰─── SC2086: Double quote to prevent globbing and word splitting.
───╯
[shell_idiom] Warning: Shell commands with a shorter idiom
   ╭─[ <temp_file_path>:5:3 ]
   │
 5 │ ╭─▶   mkdir -p $out/a
 6 │ ├─▶   mkdir -p $out/b
   │ │                       
   │ ╰─────────────────────── mkdir -p takes several directories: mkdir -p $out/a $out/b
 7 │       v=$(cat "$f")
   │           ────┬───  
   │               ╰───── $(cat file): bash reads it without cat as $(<file)
───╯
[shell_idiom] Advice: Shell commands with a shorter idiom
   ╭─[ <temp_file_path>:2:3 ]
   │
 2 │   cat $files | sort > all
   │   ┬──────────┬───────────  
   │   ╰──────────────────────── The phase doesn't run runHook preInstall
   │              │             
   │              ╰───────────── cat only feeds sort: read the file directly
   │ 
 8 │   sed -i 's,#!/usr/bin/env bash,#!${stdenv.shell},' x
   │                                                      │ 
   │                                                      ╰─ The phase doesn't run runHook postInstall
───╯
